      "date": "2026-05-30T19:47:34.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹2.89 (vs ₹11.10 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹2.89 (down from ₹11.10 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹1.61b (down 34% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹19.9m (down 74% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 1.2% (down from 3.1% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by lower revenue. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 31% per year but the company’s share price has increased by 2% per year, which means it is well ahead of earnings.",
